The main discovery experience should be designed around discovering men.

The user should be able to browse:

Crush Picks

People You Might Crush

People You Might Click With

People Around You

Recently Active

New on Crushly

Popular Spaces

People With Similar Interests

Do not make discovery feel like an endless clone of swipe-card dating apps.

Use cards, grids, lists, or other layouts depending on the UI.

The discovery experience should prioritize:

Compatibility Distance Shared interests Dating intentions Activity Mutual connections Profile quality User preferences 10. FIND 

Search should become:

Find

