22. GAY DATING EXPERIENCE 

Crushly should support several types of gay relationships and connections.

Users should be able to communicate what they want without judgment.

Examples:

Dating

Relationship

Something Serious

Something Casual

Friendship

New Connections

Chat

Not Sure Yet

Do not assume every user wants a relationship.

Do not assume every interaction is sexual.

Keep the experience respectful and community-focused.

