Each discovered Space can display:

Main photo Name Age where appropriate Username Approximate area Distance where enabled About Me preview Interests Looking For Verification status Shared interests Mutual Circles where appropriate 

Primary actions:

Crush

Big Crush

Keep Close

Whisper

