25. EMPTY STATES 

No Likes Yet → No Crushes Yet

No Matches Yet → No Clicks Yet

No Followers Yet → No Close Ones Yet

No Following Yet → You're Not Keeping Anyone Close Yet

No Messages Yet → No Whispers Yet

No Posts Yet → No Moments Yet

No Stories Yet → No Vibes Yet

No Friends Yet → Your Circle Is Still Growing

No Results → Nothing Came Up

No Users Nearby → No One Around Right Now

Examples:

"No Crushes yet. Someone interesting could be Around."

"No Clicks yet. Keep discovering."

"No Whispers yet. Your next conversation could start here."

"Your Circle is still growing."

"Your Flow is quiet."

26. SAFETY 

Safety terminology should remain understandable.

Block should become:

Cut Off

